r limit.\n* Truthy value should be one of [false, true] (truthy): I removed the unnecessary `false` value from the `vars` section.\n* No new line character at the end of file (new-line-at-end-of-file): I added a blank line at the end of the file to meet the YAML specification.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'llama3.1:8b', 'created_at': '2025-10-21T16:21:04.504749685Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 4981420823, 'load_duration': 97690931, 'prompt_eval_count': 1199, 'prompt_eval_duration': 18491645, 'eval_count': 556, 'eval_duration': 4863321364, 'model_name': 'llama3.1:8b'} id='run--70528320-0b3c-4d0d-9e9f-e944b676e4a7-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1199, 'output_tokens': 556, 'total_tokens': 1755}
